&lt;p&gt;At Prospa, you&#39;ll be part of a team that&#39;s on a mission to unleash the potential of every small business. For more than 10 years, we&#39;ve been helping small businesses succeed by making financial management simpler, faster and more seamless. From disrupting the market with fast online funding to building innovative payment solutions, we&#39;re constantly evolving to better support our customers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;As we look to the future, we&#39;re continuing to invest in world-class technology, market-leading products and talented people who are passionate about making an impact. If you&#39;re passionate about helping customers succeed, enjoy taking ownership and love turning ideas into action, you&#39;ll find plenty of opportunities to grow your career at Prospa.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We&#39;re also proud to be recognised as one of Australia&#39;s Best Workplaces, including Best Workplace in Technology and Best Workplace for Women. Join us and unleash your potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;wp-block-heading&quot;&gt;The role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own your portfolio. Grow your network. Back Aussie small businesses.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the National Sales Manager, you’ll take full ownership of a broker portfolio, growing and activating a network of&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;broker and referral partners&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;to drive consistent deal flow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;high-impact, phone-led role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;where your ability to engage, influence and energise partners will directly translate into growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be the trusted partner, helping your network understand our value, spotting opportunities, and driving mutually beneficial outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;wp-block-heading&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;wp-block-list&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Own and grow a portfolio of broker/referral partners&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;within your territory&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Proactively&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;engage, educate and activate partners&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;to drive quality deal flow&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Build strong market presence and&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;create referral momentum across your network&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Pitch and position Prospa’s value proposition&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;to generate ongoing opportunities&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Partner with the National Sales Manager and wider BDM team to&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;unlock growth opportunities&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Execute best practice&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;channel sales and engagement strategies&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;wp-block-heading&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll need to succeed&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;wp-block-list&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Proven experience in channel sales / BDM roles&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;(minimum 3+ years)&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong track record of&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;managing a territory and hitting sales targets&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience working with&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;brokers, aggregators, or referral partners&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Exposure to&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;lending, fintech, or financial services&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;(highly regarded)&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Ability to&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;build trust quickly and influence partner behaviour&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;A natural communicator—confident, engaging and commercially sharp&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Passion for&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;growing partnerships and driving results in a fast-paced environment&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;wp-block-heading&quot;&gt;Don&#39;t let a confidence gap get in the way of submitting your application.&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;wp-block-heading&quot;&gt;What we offer:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a busy grow getter, our benefits are here to help you be unstoppable in your mission. Whether it&#39;s a lofty career goal, investing in your family, saving the planet or simply feeling fulfilled:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;wp-block-list&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth&lt;/strong&gt;: There&#39;s something for everyone including learning days, a learning allowance, leadership programs, CliftonStrengths workshops, digital learning, and biannual companywide learning weeks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellbeing&lt;/strong&gt;: Think fitness initiatives, seasonal programs (including flu shots, massages, skin checks, wellness classes), additional &quot;Me Days&quot; and access to holistic EAP coaching.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lifestyle&lt;/strong&gt;: Find your fit with flexible working options, top notch office facilities and diverse remote/ travel work options. You can also purchase additional leave and take up to 18 weeks paid parental leave.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact&lt;/strong&gt;: Join a business that cares and is recertified as carbon neutral. And you can tap into volunteer days, our partnership with Kiva and join a range of employee resource groups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;wp-block-heading&quot;&gt;Why Prospa?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re proud to be a certified Great Place to Work and recognised as a Best Workplace for Women, Best Workplace in Technology, and Best Workplace in Australia. We embrace diversity in people and ideas, fostering a collaborative, inclusive, and respectful environment where we celebrate who you naturally are.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Don&#39;t just take our word for it, check out &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.canva.com/design/DAFVWLf-6HY/gkJWX100FultHNWIwaaT2A/view?utm_content=DAFVWLf-6HY&amp;amp;utm_campaign=designshare&amp;amp;utm_medium=link2&amp;amp;utm_source=uniquelinks&amp;amp;utlId=GVjPXtnOQw&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prospa’s culture code&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; to see it for yourself.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-CJ1&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;At Prospa, we exist to unleash the potential of small business. We are building the future of small business and simplifying cashflow by building a leading platform that helps customers make payments, fund growth and reduce admin. &lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;wp-block-heading&quot;&gt;The role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Register your interest for future SDR roles at Prospa!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Looking to break into sales and grow your career in a supportive, high-energy environment? The &lt;strong&gt;Sales Development Representative (SDR) Team at Prospa&lt;/strong&gt; is the perfect place to start your journey.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be joining a collaborative, high-performing team that’s passionate about helping small businesses succeed. Along the way, you’ll sharpen your sales skills, gain hands-on experience, and have plenty of opportunities for career development and progression.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;wp-block-heading&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;wp-block-list&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Making a high volume of outbound customer engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting GTM with inbound customer enquiries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding business owners’ needs and requirements while delivering exceptional customer service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating with internal stakeholders to create value and achieve outstanding outcomes for Prospa and our customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Having detailed conversations with business owners to drive commercial results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceeding key activity and performance metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;wp-block-heading&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll need to succeed&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;wp-block-list&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer-focused with a strong commitment to delivering excellent service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional with a problem-solving mindset and excellent communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to thrive in changing environments and adapt to ambiguity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-oriented with strong time management and organisational skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience in fast-paced, high-volume phone-based customer service or sales roles is advantageous.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about supporting small businesses and a strong desire to learn and develop your career in sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;wp-block-heading&quot;&gt;Don&#39;t let a confidence gap get in the way of submitting your application.&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;wp-block-heading&quot;&gt;What we offer:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a busy grow getter, our benefits are here to help you be unstoppable in your mission. Whether it&#39;s a lofty career goal, investing in your family, saving the planet or simply feeling fulfilled:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;wp-block-list&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth&lt;/strong&gt;: There&#39;s something for everyone including learning days, a learning allowance, leadership programs, CliftonStrengths workshops, digital learning, and biannual companywide learning weeks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellbeing&lt;/strong&gt;: Think fitness initiatives, seasonal programs (including flu shots, massages, skin checks, wellness classes), additional &quot;Me Days&quot; and access to holistic EAP coaching.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lifestyle&lt;/strong&gt;: Find your fit with flexible working options, top notch office facilities and diverse remote/ travel work options. You can also purchase additional leave and take up to 18 weeks paid parental leave.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact&lt;/strong&gt;: Join a business that cares and is recertified as carbon neutral. And you can tap into volunteer days, our partnership with Kiva and join a range of employee resource groups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;wp-block-heading&quot;&gt;Why Prospa?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re proud to be a certified Great Place to Work and recognised as a Best Workplace for Women, Best Workplace in Technology, and Best Workplace in Australia. We embrace diversity in people and ideas, fostering a collaborative, inclusive, and respectful environment where we celebrate who you naturally are.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Don&#39;t just take our word for it, check out &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.canva.com/design/DAFVWLf-6HY/gkJWX100FultHNWIwaaT2A/view?utm_content=DAFVWLf-6HY&amp;amp;utm_campaign=designshare&amp;amp;utm_medium=link2&amp;amp;utm_source=uniquelinks&amp;amp;utlId=GVjPXtnOQw&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prospa’s culture code&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; to see it for yourself.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;At Prospa, we exist to unleash the potential of every small business. We are building the future of small business and simplifying cashflow by building a leading platform that helps customers make payments, fund growth and reduce admin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We embrace diversity in our people and our thinking. You’ll find an environment where there’s always something new around the corner. It’s collaborative, inclusive and respectful. A place where we celebrate who you are, naturally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are always on the lookout for exceptional talent to join our team here at Prospa.&amp;nbsp;If you can&#39;t find a suitable role, we&#39;d encourage you to register your interest below and we will get in touch when we have an opening that matches your experience and skills.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

